            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Let's use this as a tracking issue to gather other similar suggestions for 'mini.doc' improvements that are related to LuaCATS specifications.\r\n\r\nIn particular:\r\n\r\n- Omit `---@field private` and `---@field protected` fields in the output. See #668 for more info.\r\n- Support multiple `---@return` statements to behave similarly to multiple `---@param` and indicate several returned values (instead of currently suggested `...`). For more info see #1027.\r\n- Make `---@module` modify function name by replacing (where it makes sense) the returned variable name (usually `M`) with module name. For more info and examples see #1227.",
